  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRConsentLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRConsentLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRConsentLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-consent</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-authorization</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>authorization</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>authorization.consent.id</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>authorization.consent.code</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>authorization.consent.statusCode=\"completed\"</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-consent</code> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/consent.html\">Consentversion: 4.0.1)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Consent (A healthcare consumer's  choices to permit or deny recipients or roles to perform actions for specific purposes and periods of time)</td><td>Référencé depuis Composition.extension:consent (ConsentExtension.value[x]:valueReference).</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Consent.identifier (Identifier for this record (external references))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent.type</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Consent.category (Classification of the consent statement - for indexing/retrieval)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMConsent.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Consent.status (draft | proposed | active | rejected | inactive | entered-in-error)</td><td/></tr></table></div>"
